{"v":4,"catch":"烏鴉需要到達塔頂以恢復平衡並將世界從遺忘中拯救出來。","desc":"Raven's Hike 是一款 2D 精密平台遊戲，具有挑戰性的遊戲，要求玩家找到完成有一點謎題的最佳路線，所有的動作都是基於主角的抓鉤。\n\n隨著遊戲的進行，難度曲線逐漸增加，需要精通控制和更精確的動作。\n\n準備好你的平台技能（當然還有你的抓鉤）來享受這種奇妙的體驗。\n\n由Wired Dream Studio開發，QUByte Interactive發行。","publisher":"QUByte Interactive","release":"2022-04-28","genres":["冒險","益智","策略","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","意大利文","荷蘭文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fab64f61d22a0e1d518ed2a275d94c743a9ad7d6a8675510a72321bd9787ed26.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b6ddc84e5ef3e77259d9da25de15e5a87480ac94366506756aa558ed6fc62f24.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1b67311df92684909282741a591d7fe6c20fc0e31a3e5fd77a9ad2b3be277545.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2f3159470c8249c6c0ba3af72cfffde9bb1553655b551f9042fcf50515e6b4a6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/86eaa965cb01c2f91f76483f32eaff06d89b6e8a21733e942409cb91b4e2dfa9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8dc41add3fbd17ddf4d1e479d524b5005e858d29e5e42ba472d121fdb25e515e.jpg"],"titleId":"01003510168e0000","dlc":[]}